de revision","cognitive_framework":"CAPS language response: Barrett-informed comprehension and literary analysis","cognitive_levels":["Literal","Reorganisation","Inference","Evaluation","Appreciation"],"classification_status":"Draft author classification; independent moderation pending","assessment_note":"Five-question formative samples do not reproduce formal examination mark weightings or assess extended written responses.","source_terms":[2,4],"atp_urls":["https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=Iw2OEg6LMVY%3d&tabid=3205&portalid=0&mid=10735"],"question_reuse":"Revision questions recur across term-focused and mixed sets; Set A and Set B within the same selection do not share questions."}},{"id":"e16fa18d-cee4-5528-a5ad-857312e61521","title":"isiXhosa HL · Grade 10 · Term 4 selection · Set B: Mixed revision","subject":"isiXhosa HL","grade":"Grade 10","questions":[{"question":"Kutheni uLutho esiya kwithala leencwadi?","options":["Ufuna ukuthengisa iincwadi.","Uya kudlala nabantakwabo.","Ufuna indawo ezolileyo yokufunda.","Usebenza apho ebusuku."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Isizathu sicaciswe kumazwi kaLutho: ufuna ukufunda kwindawo ezolileyo. Sebenzisa ubungqina obukwisicatshulwa.","stimulus":"ULutho ufika kwithala leencwadi emva kwesikolo. Uthi: Ndifuna indawo ezolileyo yokufunda kuba abantakwethu badlala ekhaya. Uphuma nencwadi enye aze abuye nayo ngoLwesihlanu.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L1","label":"Literal","band":"lower"}},{"question":"Leliphi ibango elingenabungqina kwisicatshulwa?","options":["ULutho uboleka incwadi enye.","ULutho ngoyena mfundi uphumelelayo esikolweni.","ULutho ufuna ukuzola.","ULutho ubuyisa incwadi ngoLwesihlanu."],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Akukho manqaku okanye uthelekiso lwabafundi lunikiweyo. Musa ukongeza ingxelo engaxhaswanga sisicatshulwa.","stimulus":"ULutho ufika kwithala leencwadi emva kwesikolo. Uthi: Ndifuna indawo ezolileyo yokufunda kuba abantakwethu badlala ekhaya. Uphuma nencwadi enye aze abuye nayo ngoLwesihlanu.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Leliphi ibango elifuna ubungqina obungakumbi?","options":["Le yeyona klabhu ibalaseleyo elizweni.","Iintlanganiso zingoLwesithathu.","Kukho iincwadi ekwabelwana ngazo.","Intengiso imema amalungu."],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Ukuthi yeyona ibalaseleyo kufuna imigaqo nothelekiso nezinye iiklabhu. Isibhengezo sodwa asibungqini obaneleyo.","stimulus":"Intengiso ithi: Wamkelekile kwiklabhu yokufunda! Joyina namhlanje. Sabelana ngeencwadi simahla ngoLwesithathu. Le yeyona klabhu ibalaseleyo elizweni!","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Igama simahla linokuba naliphi ifuthe?","options":["Liqinisekisa ukuba wonke umntu uya kupasa.","Linokutsala abafundi abangakwaziyo ukuhlawula.","Libonisa ukuba iklabhu ivaliwe.","Lithetha ukuba akukho ncwadi ikhoyo."],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Ukungabikho kwentlawulo kunokwenza inkonzo ifikeleleke. Akuthembisi iziphumo zezifundo kumntu wonke.","stimulus":"Intengiso ithi: Wamkelekile kwiklabhu yokufunda! Joyina namhlanje. Sabelana ngeencwadi simahla ngoLwesithathu. Le yeyona klabhu ibalaseleyo elizweni!","cognitive_level":{"code":"L5","label":"Appreciation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Ngaba ukususa ibango elithi yeyona klabhu ibalaseleyo kungasenza isimemo siphelele?","options":["Ewe; zonke iinkcukacha zokuhamba sele zinikiwe.","Hayi; isimemo ngasinye kufuneka sixoke.","Hayi; indawo nexesha lokuqala kusafuneka zicaciswe.","Ewe; igama simahla linika idilesi."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Ukususa ibango elingaxhaswanga kuphucula ukuthembeka, kodwa akuzalisi iinkcukacha ezishiyiweyo. Umfundi usafuna indawo nexesha ukuze acwangcise ukuya.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"},"stimulus":"Intengiso ithi: Wamkelekile kwiklabhu yokufunda! Joyina namhlanje. Sabelana ngeencwadi simahla ngoLwesithathu. Le yeyona klabhu ibalaseleyo elizweni!"}],"created_by":"SmartBridge FET content team","is_published":true,"description":"Mixed grade revision drawn from the other two terms. Includes later-term topics; revisit after studying those topics. Questions are reused deliberately across revision sets.","quiz_type":"practice","difficulty_level":"medium","time_limit_minutes":12,"passing_score_percentage":50,"total_questions":5,"allow_retakes":true,"show_answers_after_submission":true,"tags":["CAPS","ATP","term-4","formative","xhhl"],"metadata":{"term":4,"focus":"Mixed revision: Ukufunda ngengqiqo nokusebenzisa ubungqina; Intengiso, injongo nabaphulaphuli","language":"xh","content_version":"2026-10-21.2","content_origin":"SmartBridge original","curriculum_year":2026,"atp_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=Iw2OEg6LMVY%3d&tabid=3205&portalid=0&mid=10735","caps_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=QsGQeCZMUxo%3d&tabid=570&portalid=0&mid=1555","retention_circular_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/Portals/0/Documents/Publications/2026/Circulars/Circular%20S19%20of%202025%20and%20Annexures.pdf","verified_on":"2026-10-21","lesson_path":"/study-packs/xhhl-10","coverage":"Selected grade revision from other terms, including later-term content. Not a second paper covering only the selected term.","moderation_status":"Independent teacher and language moderation pending","term_note":"Revision included where specified by ATP; some Grade 10/11 Term 4 plans introduce new content.","set_id":"B","set_label":"Mixed grade revision","cognitive_framework":"CAPS language response: Barrett-informed comprehension and literary analysis","cognitive_levels":["Literal","Reorganisation","Inference","Evaluation","Appreciation"],"classification_status":"Draft author classification; independent moderation pending","assessment_note":"Five-question formative samples do not reproduce formal examination mark weightings or assess extended written responses.","source_terms":[2,3],"atp_urls":["https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=Iw2OEg6LMVY%3d&tabid=3205&portalid=0&mid=10735"],"question_reuse":"Revision questions recur across term-focused and mixed sets; Set A and Set B within the same selection do not share questions."}},{"id":"c8c3afdf-d431-571a-a1d8-33f32f13e00e","title":"isiZulu HL · Grade 10 · Term 2 selection · Set B: Mixed revision","subject":"isiZulu HL","grade":"Grade 10","questions":[{"question":"Iyini inhloso enkulu yesikhangiso?","options":["Ukukhuthaza abantu ukuba bajoyine ikilabhu.","Ukuchaza ukulungiswa kwemoto.","Ukubala izindleko zikaphethiloli.","Ukubika uhambo olwedlule."],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Amagama athi Woza noJoyina akhuthaza umfundi ukuba athathe isinyathelo.","stimulus":"Isikhangiso sithi: Woza ekilabhini yokufunda! Joyina namuhla. Sabelana ngezincwadi mahhala ngoLwesithathu. Lena yikilabhu ehamba phambili ezweni!","cognitive_level":{"code":"L3","label":"Inference","band":"middle"}},{"question":"Yimuphi umbuzo owusizo ngaphambi kokujoyina?","options":["Zinombala munye yini zonke izincwadi?","Isikhangiso sinyatsheliswe ngayiphi inki?","Onke amalungu anegama elifanayo yini?","Iphi indawo yokuhlangana futhi kuqalwa nini?"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Indawo nesikhathi kuyadingeka ukuze umuntu akwazi ukuhlela ukuya. Le mininingwane ayiphelele esikhangisweni.","stimulus":"Isikhangiso sithi: Woza ekilabhini yokufunda! Joyina namuhla. Sabelana ngezincwadi mahhala ngoLwesithathu. Lena yikilabhu ehamba phambili ezweni!","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Ukuthula kukaNoma kungasikisela ini?","options":["Ngokuqinisekile uwine umklomelo.","Wazi konke okuzokwenzeka.","Angase akhathazeke noma alindele okuthile.","Useyifundile incwadi."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Izenzo zinikeza umkhondo wemizwa kodwa azivezi okuqukethwe incwadi. Sebenzisa ulimi olungagabadeli ubufakazi.","stimulus":"Imvula ishaya iwindi. UNoma uphethe incwadi angakayivuli. Uthule ubheke emgwaqweni. Inhliziyo yakhe ishaya njengesigubhu.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L3","label":"Inference","band":"middle"}},{"question":"Yiluphi ulwazi olushiwo ngokucacile?","options":["Incwadi imtshela ukuthi uphumelele.","Imvula izophela ngomzuzu.","UNoma ulinde udadewabo.","UNoma akakayivuli incwadi."],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Amagama athi angakayivuli ayibufakazi obuqondile. Ezinye izimpendulo zengeza imininingwane.","stimulus":"Imvula ishaya iwindi. UNoma uphethe incwadi angakayivuli. Uthule ubheke emgwaqweni. Inhliziyo yakhe ishaya njengesigubhu.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L1","label":"Literal","band":"lower"}},{"question":"Ukuqhathanisa inhliziyo nesigubhu kunamuphi umthelela emoyeni wombhalo?","options":["Kufakazela ukuthi kukhona isigubhu sangempela egumbini.","Kusitshela amamaki akhe esikole.","Kwenza imizwa izwakale inamandla, kodwa akukuvezi okuqukethwe incwadi.","Kufakazela ukuthi incwadi isivuliwe."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Isifaniso sigcizelela ukushaya kwenhliziyo namandla omuzwa. Umthelela wolimi uyabonakala, kodwa okuqukethwe incwadi akukashiwo embhalweni.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"},"stimulus":"Imvula ishaya iwindi. UNoma uphethe incwadi angakayivuli. Uthule ubheke emgwaqweni. Inhliziyo yakhe ishaya njengesigubhu."}],"created_by":"SmartBridge FET content team","is_published":true,"description":"Mixed grade revision drawn from the other two terms. Includes later-term topics; revisit after studying those topics. Questions are reused deliberately across revision sets.","quiz_type":"practice","difficulty_level":"medium","time_limit_minutes":12,"passing_score_percentage":50,"total_questions":5,"allow_retakes":true,"show_answers_after_submission":true,"tags":["CAPS","ATP","term-2","formative","zuhl"],"metadata":{"term":2,"focus":"Mixed revision: Isikhangiso, inhloso nezethameli; Izifenqo nomlingiswa","language":"zu","content_version":"2026-10-21.2","content_origin":"SmartBridge original","curriculum_year":2026,"a